From fd3a9a130137221081b9b5e204964a08e962477a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 01:20:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] fix(ai): use installed local models and current cloud
 defaults

Discover installed Ollama models before the first automatic Send.
Probe tool support and refuse unusable discovery replies with named diagnostics.
Keep explicit model names and each preset's fallback mode.
Share the cloud defaults and reject retired defaults in the catalog test.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3782
